WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Planning illustration, not a lifting drill.
No safe weight can be chosen from a video.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
A trolley is one possible assessed option.
The model does not show loading technique.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Could the object be lighter or moved for you?
Keep hands free for your usual walking aid.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Example replay: a clear route matters.
Use equipment only after an OT assessment.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
A kitchen trolley is not a walking aid.
Do not test your strength with a heavy load.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Final replay: move only with an agreed plan.
Ask for help if balance or grip is uncertain.

00:36.000 --> 00:42.000
Choose comfort, support and access.
Practise with a light object instead.
